1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:03,245
独自出门，去见一位朋友。
Heading out on your own to meet a friend.

2
00:00:03,352 --> 00:00:08,176
对聋人和重听人士，重要的环境提醒，也应有触觉的入口。
For deaf and hard-of-hearing people, important cues should be accessible through touch.

3
00:00:08,283 --> 00:00:11,270
SoundBridge，让重要的提醒被感知。
SoundBridge. Make important cues easier to notice.

4
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:15,604
共享步道上，身后传来车铃。
On a shared path, a bicycle bell rings behind you.

5
00:00:15,714 --> 00:00:21,636
拟议系统识别声音类别，触发三次短振，并显示车铃图标和文字。
The proposed system recognizes the sound, then shows a bicycle-bell alert with three short pulses.

6
00:00:21,745 --> 00:00:25,270
提醒提供线索，接下来，观察周围。
The alert offers a cue. Next, check your surroundings.

7
00:00:26,650 --> 00:00:30,516
她停在步道一侧，转头确认骑行者的位置。
She pauses at the side of the path and checks where the cyclist is.

8
00:00:30,625 --> 00:00:34,806
确认空间后，让对方通过，再继续自己的行程。
After checking the space, she lets the cyclist pass and continues.

9
00:00:34,915 --> 00:00:37,270
选择，由她自己作出。
The decision is hers.

10
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:42,104
麦克风采集短时声音，转换为频谱特征。
Microphones capture short audio windows and convert them into spectral features.

11
00:00:42,204 --> 00:00:45,658
拟议的本地模型，识别车铃、鸣笛和门铃。
The proposed on-device model recognizes bicycle bells, horns and doorbells.

12
00:00:45,759 --> 00:00:50,195
置信度筛选、连续确认和重复抑制，再决定是否提醒。
Confidence checks, temporal confirmation and deduplication determine whether to alert.

13
00:00:50,295 --> 00:00:53,270
真实环境中的漏报和误报，仍需验证。
Missed detections and false alerts still need testing in real environments.

14
00:00:54,650 --> 00:00:58,407
声音类别映射到振动节奏，再驱动触觉马达。
Sound categories map to rhythms that drive the haptic actuator.

15
00:00:58,511 --> 00:01:02,307
门铃用两组双击，车铃和鸣笛用三次短振。
Doorbells use two paired taps; bicycle bells and horns use three short pulses.

16
00:01:02,412 --> 00:01:05,270
配合图标与文字，不只依赖颜色。
Icons and text reinforce the cue, without relying on color alone.

17
00:01:06,650 --> 00:01:09,798
来向估计，需要多麦克风硬件和校准。
Direction estimation requires multiple microphones and calibration.

18
00:01:09,898 --> 00:01:13,741
比较声音到达的时间差，估计相对手表的大致来向。
Arrival-time differences estimate an approximate direction relative to the watch.

19
00:01:13,842 --> 00:01:17,259
无法可靠判断时，明确显示方向不确定。
When the estimate is unreliable, show that the direction is uncertain.

20
00:01:17,359 --> 00:01:20,270
它不能代替观察，也不保证避开危险。
It cannot replace observation or guarantee avoidance of danger.

21
00:01:21,650 --> 00:01:25,918
拟议状态设计，让暂停、低电量和感知故障清晰可见。
The proposed status design makes pause, low battery and sensing faults visible.

22
00:01:26,022 --> 00:01:29,363
暂停或故障时，明确告知无法提供提醒。
When paused or sensing fails, clearly show that alerts are unavailable.

23
00:01:29,467 --> 00:01:32,270
没有收到提醒，不代表周围没有风险。
No alert does not mean there is no risk nearby.

24
00:01:33,650 --> 00:01:37,051
选择关注的声音，试一试不同的振动强度。
Choose the sounds to notice and try different vibration strengths.

25
00:01:37,158 --> 00:01:40,143
字号也能调整，偏好保存在本地。
Adjust text size and store preferences locally.

26
00:01:40,249 --> 00:01:44,270
与聋人和重听人士共同测试，让提示容易理解。
Test together with deaf and hard-of-hearing people to make cues understandable.

27
00:01:45,650 --> 00:01:49,269
同样的感知流程，也能用于居家门铃提示。
The same sensing flow can support doorbell alerts at home.

28
00:01:49,376 --> 00:01:53,903
振动与文字提示有人来访，让你继续专注自己的生活。
Vibration and text signal a visitor while you focus on your day.

29
00:01:54,010 --> 00:01:56,270
何时回应，由你决定。
Choose when to respond.

30
00:01:57,650 --> 00:02:01,213
居家关注门铃，户外关注车铃与鸣笛。
Home focuses on doorbells; outdoors on bicycle bells and horns.

31
00:02:01,321 --> 00:02:05,717
暂停会停止采集与提醒，并持续显示暂停状态。
Pausing stops capture and alerts, with a persistent paused indicator.

32
00:02:05,825 --> 00:02:08,270
准备好了，再恢复感知。
Resume awareness when you are ready.

33
00:02:09,650 --> 00:02:12,528
方案默认本地处理，不保存原始录音。
The proposed default is local processing without saving raw recordings.

34
00:02:12,632 --> 00:02:16,271
可选事件历史，只记录类别与时间，由你管理。
Optional event history stores category and time under your control.

35
00:02:16,375 --> 00:02:19,270
这些目标，需要在最终软硬件中落实。
These goals must be implemented in the final hardware and software.

36
00:02:20,650 --> 00:02:25,194
从独自出门，到与朋友相聚，生活按自己的节奏展开。
From heading out alone to meeting a friend, life moves at your own pace.

37
00:02:25,312 --> 00:02:29,270
SoundBridge。让重要的提醒，被及时感知。
SoundBridge. Help important cues reach you when they matter.
